### NOTE: the API now requires a logged-in session plus a CSRF token, which these plain HTTP examples do not handle.
### Use the web UI, or the curl sequence in the README ("Accounts"). The request bodies below are still accurate.

### Variables (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create a rule: when an application reaches INTERVIEW, create a prep checklist and a reminder
POST {{base}}/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Interview prep",
  "trigger": { "eventType": "application.stage_changed" },
  "conditions": [ { "field": "toStage", "op": "eq", "value": "INTERVIEW" } ],
  "actions": [
    { "type": "create_checklist", "params": { "title": "Interview prep", "items": ["Review system design notes", "Prepare 3 project stories", "Research the team"] } },
    { "type": "create_reminder", "params": { "message": "Send thank-you note", "daysFromNow": 1 } }
  ]
}

### 2. Create a rule: nudge when an application has been idle more than 7 days
POST {{base}}/api/rules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Follow up when idle",
  "trigger": { "eventType": "application.stale" },
  "conditions": [ { "field": "daysIdle", "op": "gt", "value": 7 } ],
  "actions": [ { "type": "create_reminder", "params": { "message": "Follow up with recruiter", "daysFromNow": 0 } } ]
}

### 3. Create an application
POST {{base}}/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": "Rippling", "role": "Backend Engineer", "jobUrl": "https://example.com/job/123" }

### 4. Move it forward (replace the id)
POST {{base}}/api/applications/PASTE-ID-HERE/stage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "SCREENING" }

### 5. Illegal move (APPLIED -> OFFER) returns 409
POST {{base}}/api/applications/PASTE-ID-HERE/stage
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "OFFER" }

### 6. Audit trail for one application
GET {{base}}/api/audit?entityId=PASTE-ID-HERE

### 7. Reminders that are due
GET {{base}}/api/reminders?due=true

### 8. List rules / applications
GET {{base}}/api/rules
###
GET {{base}}/api/applications?stage=INTERVIEW
